<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed index -2.2 December vs 6.4 Nov.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed index -2.2 December vs 6.4 Nov.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia said Thursday its diffusion index of business activity in the manufacturing sector fell to -2.2 in December from 6.4 in November.</p>
<p>				Dec   Drop   Unch   Rise     Nov</p>
<p>Business Conditions   - 2.2   26.8   48.6   24.6     6.4</p>
<p>New orders		  1.9   27.7   42.8   29.5     5.8</p>
<p>Shipments		   4.9   24.3   46.5   29.2    11.8</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 9.0   25.8   54.9   16.8   - 8.2</p>
<p>Delivery time	   - 9.4   19.8   67.7   10.5   -10.0</p>
<p>Inventories	     - 0.9   24.0   52.2   23.1   -14.8</p>
<p>Prices paid		13.9    7.0   72.1   20.9    14.6</p>
<p>Prices received	   6.2    5.6   80.8   11.8     1.6</p>
<p>Number of employees    -1.6   15.0   71.5   13.4     1.0</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-869-1660))</p>
</text>
